  "description": "Hogan Durkan are pleased to present this truly unique opportunity to experience luxury rental accommodation to the highest standards in arguably Limericks finest residential address.\nArd Villa, located in the grounds of Shelbourne House, North Circular Road is a stunning two-bedroom property finished and presented to the rental market to the highest standards and is certain to command both local and national attention from a range of potential tenants. \n\nShelbourne House is located on the North Circular Road, adjacent to Ard Scoil Ris Secondary School and JFK Primary School with Villiers Secondary School located 1.5km from the development and is within walking distance of Limerick City and all its associated amenities. It is also located approximately 26km from Shannon International Airport, 6.3km from University of Limerick and National Technology Park with companies such as Johnson & Johnson, Edward Life Sciences & Cook Medical there located and 6.9km from Raheen Business Park with companies such as Stryker, Regeneron, Analog, Dell there located and 4.2km from University Hospital Limerick (UHL). \n\nOn-site amenities include: \n\n- Gated Development \n- Landscaped Courtyard \n- CCTV \n- Secure Private Parking \n- Electric Car Charging Point \n- Broadband \n\nAccommodation \n\nArd Villa is a fully furnished two-bedroom property and comes finished to the highest standards. Accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, main living/dining/kitchen area with access to mezzanine overhead and two double bedrooms both of which are ensuite. The property benefits from Air-To-Water Heating and comes with fixtures and fittings of the highest standards.\n\nArd Villa is located adjacent to Shelbourne House and very careful attention has been paid to restoring and refurbishing this development to arguably one of Limericks finest residences. For further information on our flexible accommodation packages or if you wish to arrange a viewing, please email directly through this add. Brochure Available on request. \n\nViewing Details: Please note that all viewings will be held in accordance with HSE Guidelines and must be adhered to at all times. Strictly by appointment only. We are available to carry out virtual viewings. \n\nNote: These particulars are detailed for the purposes of representing the development only. Visual representations, finishes, layouts and/or scales may be approximate or representative of the development rather than exact specifications of the actual unit. Measurements and photographs provided for guidance purposes only.",
